      "message": "fix(ui): say \"work offset (G54-G59)\" plainly and drop the stale Setups-page hint\n\nThe WCS page said the work offset word is set on the Setups page, directly\nabove the dropdown that sets it. Replace that with a true line about the\nregister, and replace \"work offset word\" / \"G-word\" in the user-facing\nhints and the picker hover with plain wording. The heights page hint now\nnames the two pages that draw the control (WCS page, Setups page).\n\nFixes #876\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
