      "message": "fix(ui,app): finish the plain \"work offset\" wording and guard the WCS page\n\n- app load note: \"G54-G59 is only the word its post writes\" -> \"only the\n  work offset its post uses\" (project/wcs_one.rs).\n- MCP set_work_offset description and its schema description reworded in\n  plain words; the field name `word` and the error text are unchanged.\n- WCS page line: \"the G54-G59 register\" -> \"the G54-G59 slot this setup posts\".\n- New structural guard: the WCS page shows the work-offset dropdown and no\n  label on it points at the Setups page (tests/one_wcs.rs). structural::painted\n  is now pub(super) so the sibling test can reuse it.\n\nFixes #876\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
